        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PP3520U32D, Brushed Stainless Steel 3.5\" x 20\" Door Push Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLarge size door push plates primarily used in restaurants, warehouses and stores, but are popular in homes as well. Made of .050\" thick high quality stainless steel for longevity. Packaged with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation. The Push Plate is 3.5\" wide and 20\" long. It is made out of stainless steel with a brushed stainless steel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PP3520-Specifications.gif?v=1704354579\" width=\"498\" height=\"132\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Large Stainless Steel Door Push Plate Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-push-plate-3-5-x-20-inch-deltana-pp3520\"><b>Solid Brass 3.5\" x 20\" push plate</b></a>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana PP3520U32D Stainless Steel Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PP3520U32D.pdf?v=1691095373\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PP3520U32D Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
